OL,3,GNEWSAHope restoring historic ponds will
OL,4,Aboost wildlife
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe restoration of historic ponds at a
OL,7,Fbeauty spot will help the area to
OL,8,Fbecome a haven for wildlife, says
OL,9,FForestry England.
OL,11,FThe first images have been released by
OL,12,FForestry England showing what the two
OL,13,Freservoirs at Cannop Ponds in the
OL,14,FForest of Dean will look like when the
OL,15,Fproject is completed.
OL,17,FA new slipway will be created on the
OL,18,FLower Cannop reservoir, the dam will
OL,19,Falso be strengthened, while the Upper
OL,20,FCannop will be improved with a mixture
OL,21,Fof open water marsh and reedbeds.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
